WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.120
For a bug report, it can help to give
the agent a repeatable way to start.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.551
You pin Router’s bug fix playbook.

3
00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:13.158
The first steps are now part
of the model’s instructions.

4
00:00:13.158 --> 00:00:18.600
The agent runs the failing example to get a
clear reproduction before it investigates.

5
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:30.241
A manual pin holds for the
session until you change it.

6
00:00:30.241 --> 00:00:33.193
It gives the work a
starting point you chose.
